er, with strong contributions from both our Mortgage Insurance and Specialty Insurance businesses. Total revenue more than doubled year-over-year with the addition of Inigo, and the strategic rationale for the acquisition is already showing up in our results,", "a": "said Radian CEO Mike Weinbach", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/890926/000119312526448639/rdn-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-11", "n": 5.83, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Barry brings a rare combination of public company leadership, transformation experience and deep expertise across financial services, payments, data and technology,", "a": "said Radian Non-Executive Board Chairperson Howard B. Culang", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/890926/000119312526344694/d25089dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-06", "n": 4.55, "z": 1.34, "rz": 0.36, "earn": true, "q": "Radian delivered strong second quarter results as we benefit from our transformation into a global multi-line specialty insurer,", "a": "said Radian Chief Executive Officer Rick Thornberry", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/890926/000119312526336793/rdn-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-07", "n": 4.81, "z": 1.67, "rz": 0.82, "earn": true, "q": "This quarter marks a defining milestone for Radian, our first as a global multi-line specialty insurer following the successful acquisition of Inigo. By uniting two world-class insurance businesses, we have created a more diversified and resilient enterprise, as reflected in our exceptional first quarter results,", "a": "said Radian Chief Executive Officer Rick Thornberry", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/890926/000119312526210841/rdn-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-19", "n": 2.73, "z": 0.18, "rz": -2.52, "earn": true, "q": "We delivered a strong year in 2025, driven by the consistent performance of our mortgage insurance business and the disciplined way we manage risk and capital. Just as importantly, we took meaningful steps to shape our company f